{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1000_p", "source_sha256": "85607e124dfee45a1d3eaa45178282c1c7c2a6437f3f312c2616a392533f095d", "ja": "（紗代子のPV撮影が終わった。\n全力で駆け抜ける紗代子の姿、輝いてたな……）", "zh": "（纱代子的PV拍摄结束了。纱代子那副竭尽全力奔跑的身影，真是闪闪发光啊……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "0e23f917e753d22e9594f45b4378c33b9aea1b7cb565fbb064280f5a7bfd5ad1", "ja": "ふぅ……{$P$}、お疲れさまです！\n今日の撮影、どうでしたか？", "zh": "呼……{$P$}先生，辛苦了！\n今天的拍摄怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1002_p", "source_sha256": "611cfdb55656bcce72caaede800d6c80052d541626311d5b3d519b1618ba011c", "ja": "バッチリだったよ。\n紗代子、ずいぶん楽しそうに走ってたな。", "zh": "非常顺利。\n纱代子跑得特别开心啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "a0054123ab38968c11cebf40c7b2e4fc2333fea4b433b11af0f1c35580ff264d", "ja": "はい！　走っていて、\nなんだかすごく気持ちがよくて。", "zh": "是的！跑起来之后，感觉特别舒服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c8b6f2a75d5014eb2d18ca78eedb11b75eba2c5ace92bb5c12af9ab820c88196", "ja": "そうか。見ているこっちも気分が良くなるような、\n爽快感のある走りっぷりだったよ。", "zh": "这样啊。看着你跑步，我这边也觉得心情舒畅，你跑得真是让人神清气爽。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "5066a52a00c7ff58d8092b7764345f4c257dd1a8640edab82990e8642eb3c577", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　それと……\n急にルートを変えてもらっちゃって、すみません。", "zh": "谢谢您！还有……突然让您改变路线，真是不好意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "444ca3239cfbc0703c7cb0a41e64f7ca74c36b4e638d9d714499e360f9ec5e44", "ja": "さっき、変えてもらった道……\n私が前に住んでいたところとなんだか似てたんです。", "zh": "刚才让你改走的那条路……\n总觉得和我以前住过的地方很像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1007_p", "source_sha256": "fdbe3e9a44e1f44ebc936b8219a5cfec5586373050fc5703b7f0f5b47e0d9e1e", "ja": "そういえば紗代子は、小さいころに\n引っ越しをしたんだったな。", "zh": "说起来，纱代子小时候搬过家来着。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "990f378f60641aae604dbee5ed286afd13a4c3edd890d9eb6e14e0c75deeaa16", "ja": "はい。……引っ越すまでは、学校に通うのに、\n毎日通ってました。あの子と一緒に……。", "zh": "是的……在搬家之前，我每天都会和那孩子一起上学……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "e9edbfe3ae0e77c5f07e67296988a2c699043693d3be06ce1c604878dde3f81c", "ja": "坂道なのはわかっていたんですけど、見かけたら\nどうしてもチャレンジしたくなってしまって。", "zh": "虽然明知道是个陡坡，但一看到它，\n就无论如何都忍不住想要挑战一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "b943854f6df9291f13f1dfb769c3469bdbb823c8fd4de2d1ea4279fbf35f9cc1", "ja": "今の私なら、走れる気がして……それで。\nワガママを言ってしまって、ごめんなさい！", "zh": "我觉得现在的自己应该能跑得动……所以……对不起，任性了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1011_p", "source_sha256": "d1a12b49842036e77d7f9c500bfcf99269d6c24f22e5d32a654cb67cc733a4fc", "ja": "そうだったのか。けど、紗代子のチャレンジのお陰で、\nいい映像が撮れたと思うよ。", "zh": "原来是这样。不过，多亏了纱代子的挑战，我觉得拍到了很棒的影像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "d7cd5be5f279e6ab9c4801d07e02d442bb319c90af62e91cf78d56e99e318a21", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}！\nそう言ってもらえて、よかったです。", "zh": "谢谢您，{$P$}！能听到您这么说，太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "a802315002fa3b06ee7b245117ba9baa229ddc49baa1dc63f7bdb8320333a990", "ja": "スタッフさんにも迷惑をかけちゃいましたけど。\n挑戦させてもらえて、心残りはありません！", "zh": "虽然给工作人员添了麻烦，不过能让我挑战一次，我已经没有遗憾了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "bdd094cf88eb85a25d1dcc4286d41634aae739071e7274c75d1da941a06f749f", "ja": "そう……心残りは、ないんですけど……。", "zh": "嗯……我没有遗憾，只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1015_p", "source_sha256": "9c98af1108aae987de649551034900f45ac6169d10ef6ea99ab9c501392b39a1", "ja": "どうかしたのか？", "zh": "怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "83d9aaf39b17b7754a2ac0a562ddf48392dcb703ca34610cd102eb6aaa22a70f", "ja": "いえ、その……それが。\nなんだかまだ、走り足りないような気がして……。", "zh": "没什么，只是……那个。\n总觉得好像还没跑够……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1017_p", "source_sha256": "3e30faa80de01e9852eb3ab74c01218d43a418628c8b693aac39ccead8429b15", "ja": "ええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "1c74ecd1c52ca96bf2615f2fea4e83658a29be2ee529f24de87db61a25b5fe8d", "ja": "あっ、いえ！　今すぐ走りたいとか、\nそういうことじゃないんですけど……。", "zh": "啊，不是！我并不是说想现在就跑起来，  \n不是这个意思……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "a9f8a6b290b0c95cd886e0d31caaa45b51a29acfa6c716f4be1aedf5ea4d5c6b", "ja": "走り続けているうちに、走り方がわかってきて……\nそれが、自分でもなんだかうれしくて。", "zh": "一直跑下去的过程中，我渐渐明白了该怎么跑……自己也觉得有点开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "fe3760f43941d244c49ebf83aa475f43da5fdfa3cf68e72e3c589b5a7e0e0fec", "ja": "この勢いのまま、私……\n行けるところまで行ってみたい、って思ったんです！", "zh": "我想就保持着这股势头……\n一直走到自己能走到的地方！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1021_p", "source_sha256": "68c3bff5ebfe745ed6aae9d74c36f5ed10a2f458624ca203522f49dd9f351bb4", "ja": "はは、なるほど。\n次の仕事に向けてのやる気は十分、って所だな！", "zh": "哈哈，原来如此。\n看来你已经干劲十足地准备迎接下一份工作了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1022_p", "source_sha256": "c2d934ba1861aac484c968abb676204ef467c7258ab8a5d29dcc83cd8e487ff1", "ja": "わかった。プロデューサーとして、\n紗代子が挑戦したくなるような坂道を用意するよ。", "zh": "我知道了。作为制作人，\n我会为你准备一段让你想要发起挑战的坡道的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1023_027say", "source_sha256": "879a29bdd0b6fc73b213f52335e207dca080c623b7427c90fd573791c05f698e", "ja": "ありがとうございます！\nたくさん挑戦させてくださいね！　……ふふっ♪", "zh": "非常感谢您！\n请让我多多接受挑战吧！……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0214_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0214_1024_p", "source_sha256": "70c4037692aa47e29beb74a942d6537ac5d02bf3ac6d21eff846110af61cba48", "ja": "（道が険しく果てしないほど、その先にある景色は、\nきっと綺麗なものだ。一緒に見ような、紗代子！）", "zh": "（道路越是险峻而漫长，前方的景色就一定越是美丽。我们一起去看看吧，纱代子！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
